            <div class="bg-primary-600 text-white rounded-full w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold">3</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-center text-gray-900">Digital Pass Generated</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-center">Approved students receive a digital pass that can be shown at campus
